+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+without mutating either JSON input. Object patches recursively merge their members; `null` removes an
+object member, and a non-object patch replaces the target.
+
+```ts
+applyMergePatch(
+  { service: { port: 8080, debug: true } },
+  { service: { debug: null, host: 'localhost' } },
+); // { service: { port: 8080, host: 'localhost' } }
+```
