+
+Implement and export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` according to RFC 7386. It must accept JSON
+documents, return a newly merged JSON value without mutating either input, recursively merge object
+patches, delete object members represented by `null`, and replace the target for non-object patches.
+
+Document the public API and cover the RFC examples plus validation and immutability edge cases.
